<title>USA: Midwest Bancshares launches buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Midwest Bancshares launches buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Iowa 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midwest Bancshares Inc said Wednesday it intends to repurchase up to 17,500 of its common shares, representing five percent of its stock, over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The parent of Midwest Federal Savings and Loan Association of Eastern Iowa completed a repurchase program involving 18,411 common shares in January.</p>
<p>As of March 31, the company had 348,339 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
